><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250515134849+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250515134852+10'00'" name="4b512d74-f4ab-4d16-b078-d743a1264342" page="4" coords="36.000000,167.633392,298.997803,167.633392,36.000000,156.603470,298.997803,156.603470,36.000000,155.954254,298.989777,155.954254,36.000000,144.924332,298.989777,144.924332,36.000000,144.275146,298.992554,144.275146,36.000000,133.245224,298.992554,133.245224,36.000015,132.596024,298.978027,132.596024,36.000015,121.566101,298.978027,121.566101,36.000015,120.916901,298.916809,120.916901,36.000015,109.886978,298.916809,109.886978,36.000015,109.237793,298.977692,109.237793,36.000015,98.207870,298.977692,98.207870,36.000015,97.558670,298.968353,97.558670,36.000015,86.528748,298.968353,86.528748,36.000015,85.936554,298.931946,85.936554,36.000015,74.906631,298.931946,74.906631,36.000015,74.257446,298.970337,74.257446,36.000015,63.227524,298.970337,63.227524,36.000015,62.578323,299.008911,62.578323,36.000015,51.548401,299.008911,51.548401,36.000015,50.899216,81.177399,50.899216,36.000015,39.869293,81.177399,39.869293" rect="35.655304,39.524597,299.353607,167.978088" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The current study has demonstrated that an energy gel with the&#xD;addition of menthol at 0.1–0.5% provides a cooling sensation for&#xD;athletes with a dose–response when ingested during exercise in&#xD;warm-hot conditions, with very few cases of gastrointestinal&#xD;disturbance. The overall experience of using the gel was similar&#xD;to placebo at 0.1%, and significantly worse than placebo at 0.5%.&#xD;The data presented and ensuing recommendations can be used by&#xD;researchers to continue to optimize the development of menthol&#xD;supplements and can be used by industry to produce a safe and&#xD;effective menthol supplement that is commercially available on a&#xD;large scale.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="4" rect="612.000000,75.633392,796.000000,167.633392"
/></highlight
